{"id":119,"date":"2016-05-16T12:49:32","date_gmt":"2016-05-16T12:49:32","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/masterbadminton.dev\/can-i-use-a-twisted-racquet-to-play-badminton\/"},"modified":"2016-09-01T07:57:47","modified_gmt":"2016-09-01T07:57:47","slug":"can-i-use-a-twisted-racquet-to-play-badminton-html","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/can-i-use-a-twisted-racquet-to-play-badminton.html","title":{"rendered":"Can I use a twisted racquet to play badminton?"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"ContentColumn\">\n<div class=\"Liner\">\n<style type=\"text\/css\"><![CDATA[.errFld{padding:3px}.errFldOn{padding:0px;border:3px solid red}.errMsg{font-weight:bold;color:red;visibility:hidden}.errMsgOn{visibility:visible}#edit textarea{border:1px solid #000}.editTitle{font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center}#preview .editTitle{margin-top:0px}.editName,.editCountry{text-align:center}.editName,.editCountry,.editBody{}.editBody{text-align:left}#preview{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}.GadSense{float:left;vertical-align:top;padding:0 8px 8px 0;margin:0 8px 0px 0}.gLinkUnitTop{width:466px;margin:12px auto}.gLinkUnitBot{width:120px;float:right;margin:4px 0 24px 36px}]]><\/style>\n<div id=\"submission_28619385\" style=\"border:0px solid black;padding:5px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<p>        by Anonymous<\/p>\n<p>(Quebeq, Canada)<\/p>\n<\/p>\n<div style=\"clear:left\"\/><b>Question:<\/b> Can we play badminton with a twisted badminton racquet?<\/p>\n<p><b>Answer:<\/b><br \/>Hi there, thanks for asking us a question.<\/p>\n<p>I assume you mean using a distorted racket frame. <\/p>\n<p>There is probably a crack somewhere around the frame of your racket head. <\/p>\n<p>I wouldn\u2019t advise you to play with a twisted\/distorted racket. <\/p>\n<p>Firstly you will not perform well. <\/p>\n<p>More importantly, your racket might break and you might also injure yourself. If you\u2019re playing doubles you might also risk injuring your partner. <\/p>\n<p>As you continue to hit shuttles with your distorted racket, there will be even more pressure on the racket frame. This will cause the racket to become even more distorted. <\/p>\n<p>My advice will be to cut the strings on your racket once you discover a crack on the racket frame. A small crack can sometimes be repaired. <\/p>\n<p>If you leave the strings on, the string tension will distort the shape of your racket further and the crack becomes bigger.<\/p><\/div>\n<p>\n\t <a href=\"can-i-use-a-twisted-racquet-to-play-badminton-comment-form.html\" class=\"old-comments\">Click here to post comments<\/a>\n         <\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">\n              <a href=\"badminton-questions.html\"><br \/>\n              Return to General Badminton Questions.<\/a>\n            <\/p>\n<h3 class=\"fblikeste\">Like Masterbadminton.com?<\/h3>\n<p\/>\n<div id=\"fb-root\"\/><script><![CDATA[(function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(d.getElementById(id)){return;}js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\"..\/connect.facebook.net\/en_US\/all.js#xfbml=1\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}(document,'script','facebook-jssdk'));]]><\/script><like href=\"index.html\" send=\"false\" width=\"450\" show_faces=\"false\"\/>\n<div align=\"left\">\n<like-box href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/How-To-Play-Badminton\/365607500122681\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" show_faces=\"false\" stream=\"true\" header=\"true\"\/>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>by Anonymous (Quebeq, Canada) Question: Can we play badminton with a twisted badminton racquet? Answer:Hi there, thanks for asking us a question. I assume you mean using a distorted racket frame. There is probably a crack somewhere around the frame of your racket head. I wouldn\u2019t advise you to play with a twisted\/distorted racket. Firstly [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sti